 "stimulus_html": "<ol start=\"5\">\n<li>Two objects are launched into the air.</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The height, in feet, of Object A is given by the equation <span data-math=\"f(t)=4+32t−16t^2\">f(t)=4+32t−16t^2</span>.</p></li>\n<li><p>The height, in feet, of Object B is given by the equation <span data-math=\"g(t)=2.5+40t−16^2\">g(t)=2.5+40t−16^2</span>.</p></li>\n<li><p>In both functions, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> is seconds after launch.</p></li></ul>",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 669190,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Which object was launched from a greater height?</li>\n  </ol>",
